# =============================================================================
# Catalyst One Pilot — verified live Supabase SSOT
# Project: Catalyst One Platform
# Project ID: unpjfzvlokovobxgvazo
# Historical (do not use): swbrjrrapwdtgkpdbphe (scaffold), lspghyjozleqovrtdxqe (RCLIP interim)
